{title: Child of God}
{artist: Melinda Fletcher}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}

God He is greater than the trials we face 

For we are redeemed by the power of His grace 

I will climb every mountain

I will see Him part the sea 

I will walk on the water 

With Christ in me 



I am a child of the most high God

Highly favoured and deeply loved 

Blessed beyond all measure 

I am His treasure 

Made in His image 

And redeemed by His blood 



God He is greater than the giants we face 

For we are redeemed by the power of His grace 

I will saw like an eagle 

I will scale every wall 

As I sing hallelujah 

I will see the giants fall 



I am a child of the most high God

Highly favoured and deeply loved 

Blessed beyond all measure 

I am His treasure 

Made in His image 

And redeemed by His blood 



I am seated with Christ in heaven 

Sin and Satan are underneath my feet 

I am born of God and filled by His Spirit 

Jesus Christ is alive and well in me 



I am a child of the most high God

Highly favoured and deeply loved 

Blessed beyond all measure 

I am His treasure 

Made in His image 

And redeemed by His blood 



God He is worthy of all praises we bring 

For He is Almighty The King above all kings 

I will tell of His goodness 

I will sing about His love 

I will shout from the rooftops there is power in His blood 



I am a child of the most high God

Highly favoured and deeply loved 

Blessed beyond all measure 

I am His treasure 

Made in His image 

And redeemed by His blood 



I have hope and a future 

I have love and a purpose 

I am living for Jesus 

I am a child of God!
